    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20855" root="سن" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنُونٌ</span></b>  <i>A dentifrice;</i> (S, M, L, K;) <i>a medicament with which the teeth are rubbed and cleansed,
compounded for the purpose of strengthening and
freshening them:</i> (L:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنُونَاتٌ</span>. (K in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سرط</span> [where, in the CK, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُفُوفَاتٌ</span> is erroneously
put in its place].) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنِينَةٌ</span>.

